{"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","max_tokens":1024,"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Examples\n\nEXAMPLE INPUT:\n    Ive got email Frank - their developer, who's 30. His Twitter handle is @frankch. Btw, he plays on drums!\n    \n    EXAMPLE OUTPUT:\n    ```json\n    {\"age\":30,\"name\":\"Frank\",\"username\":\"@frankch\",\"role\":\"developer\",\"hobbies\":[\"playing drums\"]}\n    ```\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that matches this JSON Schema:\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"User\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"age\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"username\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"role\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n                \"guest\",\n                \"user\",\n                \"admin\"\n            ],\n            \"x-php-class\": \"UserType\"\n        },\n        \"hobbies\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"Correctly extract items of type: string\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n        \"age\",\n        \"name\",\n        \"username\",\n        \"role\",\n        \"hobbies\"\n    ],\n    \"x-php-class\": \"User\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"Jason (@jxnlco) is 25 years old and is the admin of this project. He likes playing football and reading books."}],"response_format":{"type":"json_object"}}